Package: dbiR
Title: Quantify Behavioral Asymmetry in Text Message Conversations
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Shawn", "Wang", , "shawn.wang.1667@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for reading exported iMessage conversation threads and
    scoring dyadic conversations on behavioral asymmetry. Parses raw
    'imessage-exporter' text files into tidy message-level data, cleans and
    tokenizes message text against lexical and emotion norms, and computes the
    Down Bad Index (DBI): a weighted composite of five per-conversation ratios
    capturing who initiates exchanges, who replies faster, who is left on read,
    and who sends more words and messages.
